  "name": "Tinker: Rejuvenating Gadget and Stim Augmentation fire on a Zap! that lands on a full-health target (#11299)",
  "contract": [
    "Rejuvenating Gadget 805306: critical Zap! applies Rejuvenating Gas 706255 to allies around the target, restoring 15% of the value of the shot.",
    "Stim Augmentation 653239 (equip aura 653240): direct healing abilities heal nearby allies for an additional 20% of the amount healed via 653241.",
    "Both gated on the effective heal, which is 0 when the primary target is at full health, so neither fired. They now use the heal including overheal (Spell::GetScriptHealingIncludingOverheal, HealInfo::GetHeal), as Blessed By The Stars does after #11244.",
    "Resourceful Tech 560791 makes Zap! a guaranteed crit on an ally carrying the Tinker's Nanobots. The Tinker with only a gun zaps a full-health Nanobot ally while a grouped ally beside it is wounded.",
    "Control: without the talents the same Zap! leaves no Gas on the wounded ally and no 653241 heal. With them, both appear."
  ],
